## 🧪 Test Types

### web-portal/ Tests
```bash
cd web-portal
npm test                    # Vitest / Jest
npm run lint              # ESLint
npm run type-check        # TypeScript check
```

### backend/ Tests
```bash
cd backend
npm test:unit             # Unit tests (Jest)
npm test:integration      # Integration tests
npm test:e2e              # E2E tests (Supertest)
npm run test:cov          # Coverage report
```

### app/ Tests (Flutter)
```bash
cd app
flutter test               # unit + acceptance
flutter test integration_test  # e2e thiết bị thật
```

### research/ Tests (Python)
```bash
cd research
pytest                     # all tests
pytest --cov             # with coverage
```

## ✅ MUST
- Mỗi PR phải có test — coverage không giảm
- Test behavior, not implementation
- web-portal/: Vitest/Jest + React Testing Library
- backend/: Jest + Supertest + integration tests
- app/: Flutter test + integration_test
- research/: pytest + pytest-cov

## ❌ NEVER
- Skip test không có lý do rõ ràng
- Fake coverage — chỉ test happy path
